  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green partnership for strengthening public actors in eastern Baltic Sea Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Goal:  To preserve, strengthen, and develop a resilient, professional, and values-driven civil society partnership that is equipped to influence current environmental issues and lead towards future green resilience and recovery. 

This includes activities in Ukraine that address the gender gap which exists in the sectors of waste management and organic agriculture, the need for river restoration and psychological recovery, and the need to map out the state of persistent organic pollutants.</narrative>
  </description>
